Subject: Point the inverse proxy launcher at the package's FHS install paths

Origin: DHI-internal (package/main/kubeflow-pipelines-inverse-proxy-agent build)
Description: Upstream's launcher hardcodes /opt/bin/proxy-forwarding-agent and runs get_proxy_url.py with whatever python3 is first on PATH. The package installs the agent at /usr/bin and the script and its venv under /usr/lib/kubeflow-pipelines-inverse-proxy-agent, so both references are rewritten to those paths. Flags, environment and control flow are unchanged.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/kubeflow/pipelines.git 555bfa60a70da88c594960bdacfd78fa7c061043
Verify: cmd `go test ./package/main/kubeflow-pipelines-inverse-proxy-agent/tests -run TestInverseProxyAgentDEB -count=1` expect "ok"
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI install layout only; upstream's image keeps its /opt layout)
Drop-When: never: upstream's launcher hardcodes /opt/bin, which FHS reserves for the local administrator

--- a/proxy/attempt-register-vm-on-proxy.sh
+++ b/proxy/attempt-register-vm-on-proxy.sh
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@
   # Start the proxy process
   # https://github.com/google/inverting-proxy/blob/master/agent/Dockerfile
   # Connect proxy agent to Kubeflow Pipelines UI
-  /opt/bin/proxy-forwarding-agent \
+  /usr/bin/proxy-forwarding-agent \
         --debug=${DEBUG} \
         --proxy=${PROXY_URL}/ \
         --proxy-timeout=${PROXY_TIMEOUT} \
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@
 if [[ -z "${PROXY_URL}" ]]; then
   # Get latest Proxy server URL
   curl -fsSL https://storage.googleapis.com/ml-pipeline/proxy-agent-config.json -o proxy-agent-config.json
-  PROXY_URL=$(python3 ${DIR}/get_proxy_url.py --config-file-path "proxy-agent-config.json" --location "${INSTANCE_ZONE}" --version "latest")
+  PROXY_URL=$(/usr/lib/kubeflow-pipelines-inverse-proxy-agent/venv/bin/python3 /usr/lib/kubeflow-pipelines-inverse-proxy-agent/get_proxy_url.py --config-file-path "proxy-agent-config.json" --location "${INSTANCE_ZONE}" --version "latest")
 fi
 if [[ -z "${PROXY_URL}" ]]; then
     echo "Proxy URL for the zone ${INSTANCE_ZONE} no found, exiting."
